Scope note

- This licence covers the application source code in this repository.
- The legal texts in `src/data/articles.json` are the Criminal Code of the
  Republic of Armenia as published by the Armenian Legal Information System
  (ARLIS, https://www.arlis.am). They are official acts of state and are not
  subject to this licence; ARLIS remains the authoritative source.
- The illustrations in `src/assets/`, `public/` and `design/` are the
  project's own artwork and are not covered by the MIT licence; please ask
  before reusing them outside this project.
- Bundled fonts are used under the SIL Open Font License (see each
  `@fontsource/*` package).
